/T (The Hospital Emergency Queue Management System demonstrates how C programming and priority-based queue operations can organize a simulated waiting list. It includes registration, priority ordering, display, service, search, and statistics. The project reinforces fundamental DSA concepts and offers a base for further enhancement.)
